rk:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} -> ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gray</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((卡诺图))&#10;    构造规则&#10;      格雷码排列&#10;      环绕连通&#10;      2的幂次方组&#10;    化简操作&#10;      画最大矩形圈&#10;      最少圈覆盖&#10;      允许重叠&#10;    扩展&#10;      无关项标X&#10;      POS化简圈0格&#10;      五六变量叠加图&#10;    工程价值&#10;      直观可视化&#10;      2-4变量最高效&#10;      超过4变量用EDA\">mindmap\n  root((卡诺图))\n    构造规则\n      格雷码排列\n      环绕连通\n      2的幂次方组\n    化简操作\n      画最大矩形圈\n      最少圈覆盖\n      允许重叠\n    扩展\n      无关项标X\n      POS化简圈0格\n      五六变量叠加图\n    工程价值\n      直观可视化\n      2-4变量最高效\n      超过4变量用EDA</pre><ul>\n<li>卡诺图利用格雷码邻接将代数合并转化为几何画圈，对 2-4 变量函数极为高效</li>\n<li>画圈规则：大小为 2 的幂、矩形、越大越好、数量最少、允许重叠</li>\n<li>卡诺图边界环绕连通，四角格子也可能属于同一组</li>\n<li>无关项标为 X，按需包含以获得更大的圈</li>\n<li>SOP 化简圈 1 格，POS 化简圈 0 格，选择项数更少的形式</li>\n<li>超过四变量后卡诺图的直观性下降，工业实践中使用 Espresso 等算法自动化简</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卡诺图与最小化","id":"卡诺图与最小化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"二变量与三变量卡诺图","id":"二变量与三变量卡诺图"},{"level":2,"text":"四变量卡诺图","id":"四变量卡诺图"},{"level":2,"text":"无关项处理与 POS 化简","id":"无关项处理与-pos-化简"},{"level":2,"text":"五变量与六变量扩展","id":"五变量与六变量扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"布尔表达式化简","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/boolean-algebra/boolean-simplification"},"next":{"title":"基本逻辑门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/digital-logic/logic-gates/basic-gates"}}